
🧩 Creating a DFDL Schema File from a C Header File

🔹 Purpose:

IBM IIB / ACE me DFDL schema banana chahte ho directly kisi C structure (.h file) se — matlab agar tumhare paas ek system ka data structure C me likha hua hai, to manually field define karne ki zarurat nahi.
Toolkit automatically us C header file ko read karke ek DFDL .xsd schema bana deta hai.


---

⚙️ Steps:

1. Open Wizard:

Click → File > New > Other > Message Model

Select C header file option.



2. Choose Input File:

Select the .h file (header file) jisme tumhara structure defined hai.



3. Wizard Process:

Step through the wizard → click Next on each panel.

Click Finish → DFDL schema automatically generate ho jaata hai.



4. Result:

DFDL .xsd file created (mapped with C structure fields).

Open hota hai DFDL Schema Editor me.





---

💡 Additional Info:

Tum ek single header file import kar sakte ho.

IBM ke predefined DFDL C format schema ko bhi import ya replace kar sakte ho.

Agar tum multiple header files ek sath import karna chahte ho → command line se karna padta hai (but vo MRM domain ke liye hota hai, DFDL ke liye nahi).



---

🚫 Importing from C (DFDL): Restrictions / Limitations

IBM ne kuch practical restrictions bataye hain jo import time errors ya warnings dete hain 👇

⚠️ Problem Area	🧠 Description / Restriction

typedef	Anonymous struct ke typedef ko fully support nahi karta
Empty struct/union	Do same-name messages ban jate hain
#if / #ifdef / #else macros	C preprocessor macros ko handle nahi karta → import se pehle remove karo
Hex constants (0x80)	Exception throw karte hain → decimal me replace karo
Trigraphs (??= etc.)	Support nahi karta
Syntax issues	C file syntactically correct hona chahiye, nahi to unpredictable results / crash
64-bit int	Imported as xsd:int (32-bit). Agar 64-bit chahiye to manually change → xsd:long
Anonymous struct inside struct	Error throw karta hai → sab structure ko tag (name) do
Enums with negative value	Exception throw karta hai
Uppercase / underscore names	Names alter ho jate hain import ke baad
3D char arrays	Wrong maxLength ya Java exception
C/C++ reserved keywords	Import fail ho jaata hai silently (compl, etc.)
Bit fields	Imported as xs:hexBinary, manually fix karna padta hai
Octal constants (080)	Wrong interpret hota hai (decimal maan leta hai) → fix manually



