Step	Description

1️⃣	Open New → Message Model → C header file
2️⃣	Select .h file and step through wizard
3️⃣	Click Finish → DFDL schema (.xsd) created
4️⃣	Schema opens in DFDL Editor for editing
⚠️	Some restrictions apply (typedef, macros, 64-bit int, etc.)



---

⚙️ Quick Fix Tips (Exam / Practical Use):

❌ Remove preprocessor macros (#ifdef, #else, etc.)

✅ Give names to anonymous structures

⚠️ Replace hex / octal constants

⚙️ Change xsd:int → xsd:long if 64-bit int used

💡 Fix bit fields type to match C definition



